.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SPT-SESSION 1  "session " 
.SH NAME
session \- Inspect and manage active sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsession\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and manage active sessions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
session\-list(1)
List sessions
.TP
session\-show(1)
Show a session
.TP
session\-close(1)
Close a session
.TP
session\-drain(1)
Drain sessions for a profile
.TP
session\-top(1)
Top\-style live view
.TP
session\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  spt session list \-\-profile edge
  spt session show abc123 \-\-json
  spt session close abc123 \-\-grace 5s \-\-reason "drain"
  spt session drain \-\-profile edge \-\-timeout 30s
  spt session top \-\-sort bytes \-\-limit 20
